  3
NOTES - PROPOSED DRAFT 0.2.3, SCRATCH - NOT ISSUED (OPTION C2)\P1. Units mm. Room sizes are CLEAR INTERNAL (finished face to finished face); overall dimensions are EXTERNAL. GIA per dwelling 104.13 m2 (NDSS para 8: internal faces of perimeter walls, 
  3
incl. partitions). Building footprint 18.60 x 12.30 m = 228.78 m2. Dwelling B mirrors dwelling A about the party-wall centreline.\P2. Accessibility target M4(2) - an optional requirement that applies only where a planning condition requires it (ADM V
  3
ol 1 para 0.3). Bathroom A: bath, WC and basin to ADM Diagram 2.5 with provision for a future level-access shower at the bath position; bathroom door opens outward (2.27d). Living-room principal window sill max 850 mm (2.24c). Conservatory door 1,000
  3
 opening (approx. 850 clear). Draft 0.2.2: Bedroom 1 and 2 entries are double doors (900 + 500 leaves) facing each other across the hall; store opening 1,600 with bypass panels; kitchen-utility pocket sliding door, 850 opening. Proposed 0.2.3 (VF-07 
  3
Option A): each kitchen base run is set back to give a 300 mm minimum clear nib at the pocket-door latch jamb, measured to the finished face of the end panel or worktop; pocket-door system and clear opening not yet selected. Door sizes subject to a d
  3
oor schedule.\P3. Ventilation: MVHR (ADF 2021 paras 1.67-1.73). Unit allowance in utility/plant; duct routes TBD (roof not designed). Purge ventilation by openable windows and the rooflight.\P4. Rooflight over living/dining approx. 1.0 m2 net glazing
  3
, openable, solar-control glazing and external blind. Size and position subject to daylight (BS EN 17037) and overheating (ADO / TM59) assessment.\P5. Food storage: tall larder units in the kitchen (no walk-in pantry).\P6. PROVISIONAL (not yet suppor
  3
ted by evidence): wall build-ups 300/200/100; orientation (north assumed); conservatory outline (S-08 basis; revised in Draft 0.2.2 to 2.6 x 1.5 m with 300 mm chamfers); porches, patios, 1.5 m paths and all external works. Site boundary NOT SHOWN (no
  3
 survey). Battery storage location NOT SHOWN.\P7. Concept drawing only. Geometry tested by script; NOT a planning, Building Regulations (Parts B, E, F, K, L, M, O) or fire-safety compliance claim. Professional review required.\P8. Draft 0.1 is retain
  1
ed unchanged (MMUCO_ORION_Duplex_Floor_Plan.dxf).
